<title>CANADA: Northern Telecom plans preferred issue.</title>
<headline>Northern Telecom plans preferred issue.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northern Telecom Ltd said on Monday it plans to issue, on or about Nov. 26, C$300 million of cumulative redeemable class A 2001, 5.10 percent preferred shares.</p>
<p>The 12 million shaes will be priced at C$25 each.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto bureau 416-941-8100</p>
</text>
